      "id": 3573,
      "title": "Instagram: 16 Dec 2025",
      "excerpt": "We are thrilled to announce the strategic partnership between LPAS and @bluwatrmedia. The combination of LPAS’s reputation, expertise, and culture with Bluwatr’s deep industry knowledge and forward-thinking technology approach creates a truly transformational alliance. Our partnership is grounded in shared values, foremost among them is a belief in the power of great people doing great work together.\n\nThrough this partnership, we will build on our strong foundation while ensuring LPAS continues to operate as you know it. Together, we are well positioned to accelerate growth, enhance client service, and help shape the future of architecture and design.",
