      "id": 3581,
      "title": "Instagram: 28 Jul 2025",
      "excerpt": "We're proud to share our latest contribution to the evolving landscape on the edge of Silicon Valley: Chroma by Lennar is a two-building condominium community in Fremont’s rapidly growing Warm Springs Innovation District. Anchored by Tesla Motors and connected by the Warm Springs BART station, this vibrant, master-planned neighborhood is quickly becoming one of the Bay Area’s most desirable places to live and work.\n\nChroma is where smart design meets the spirit of innovation, offering thoughtfully designed homes ranging from 690 to 1,495 square feet, with open-concept floor plans, premium finishes, and energy-efficient features. Residents enjoy access to curated amenities including a podium-level courtyard, fitness center, clubhouse, pet wash, and activated community spaces. \n\nSee the full project at: https://www.lpas.com/projects/chroma-at-innovation-condominiums",
